---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import BriefingForm from '../components/BriefingForm.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Decoheron - Solutions-Focused Cyber Security & Director Liability Reduction">
    <header class="py-5">
        <div class="container py-4">
            <div class="row gy-4 align-items-start">
                <div class="col-lg-5">
                    <span class="badge bg-primary mb-3 px-3 py-2 text-uppercase fs-6">
                        Liability Reduction, not technical complexity
                    </span>
                    <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold text-primary mb-4">
                        Shield Your Business.<br>
                        Protect Your Board.
                    </h1>
                </div>

                <div class="col-lg-7">
                    <p class="lead text-subtle mb-4 fs-5">
<!-- We replace security confusion with a single, clear outcome: underwriter-aligned control architecture tailored to your business. By implementing concrete safeguards that satisfy government-backed standards rather than relying on bloated tech stacks, we ensure your controls withstand both regulatory and insurance scrutiny. You gain maximum coverage integrity, reduced premium friction, and defensible board protection. -->
We replace the confusion and complexity of security with a single, clear outcome: controls your board can point to, evidenced and audit-ready, whoever's asking. Instead of selling you new tools, we turn the Microsoft security you already own into controls that satisfy regulators, insurers, and your largest clients. The result is fewer disputed claims, less audit friction, and a defensible position for your board.
                    </p>

                    <ul class="list-unstyled hero-value-list">
                        <li class="d-flex mb-3 align-items-start">
                       <!--     <span class="square-bullet me-3">■</span> -->
                            
                            <span class="square-bullet me-3">●</span>
                            <div>
                                <strong>Regulatory Defensibility:</strong> Controls mapped directly to the obligations your business is actually subject to, evidenced and ready for examination.
                            </div>
                        </li>
                        <li class="d-flex mb-3 align-items-start">
                            <span class="square-bullet me-3">●</span>
                            <div>
                                <strong>Evidentiary Risk:</strong> Attestations you can make truthfully, so a technical gap doesn't void the payout when you need it.
                            </div>
                        </li>
                        <li class="d-flex align-items-start">
                            <span class="square-bullet me-3">●</span>
                            <div>
                                <strong>Outcome-Focused:</strong> Deterministic control enforcement, meaning a control either works or it doesn't. No estimates, no maturity opinions, no alert noise.
                            </div>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="lead text-subtle mb-4 fs-6">
                                Certainty, not probability. That's what a board can point to.
                    </p>
                    
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="row justify-content-center mt-5">
                
            </div>
            <div class="row justify-content-center mt-5">
                <div class="col-auto">
                    <a href="/liabilities" class="btn btn-outline-navy btn-lg px-4">Understand Your Liability</a>
                </div>
                <div class="col-auto">
                    <a href="/solution" class="btn btn-outline-navy btn-lg px-4">Understand Our Solution</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <BriefingForm />
</BaseLayout>
